223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 62 0 R
/E (Separating source-specific ingestion from common Hadoop storage makes the architecture easier to control and audit. Database-aware incremental ingestion reduces repeated transfer, while metadata and checksums help prevent exact duplicates. HDFS provides scalable distributed storage, while an independent recovery strategy addresses backup reliability.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [22]
>>
